      "id": "authenticated-bounded-inspection",
      "type": "contract",
      "statement": "GET /api/v1/approvals and GET /api/v1/approvals/{approval_id} require an intact authenticated human read role plus approvals:read before repository access. Lists select and exact-hydrate at most limit + 1 rows with filter-bound opaque keyset cursors, omit payload and hash, and issue no count query. Detail uses the historical inspectable seam and exposes only the authorized safe projection and links.",
